== Latest predictions ==

=== Probability of Republican takeover ===
Several websites use [[poll aggregation]] and [[psephology]] to estimate the probability that the Republican Party will gain enough seats to take control of the Senate. On November 2, 2014, Vice President Joe Biden predicted, as reported by CNN, that the Democratic Party will retain control of the Senate, stating, "I predict we're gonna ... keep the Senate." <ref>http://www.cnn.com/2014/11/03/politics/joe-biden-senate/</ref> <!--keep as Biden is the highest official to state this, replace if President Obama chimes in -->

